    <data key="d0">Launchmetrics Architectural Ingestion and Enrichment Pipeline</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">System processes content ingestion, coordinates state via Kinesis and SQS, enriches data via EC2 Spot, and stores results in Aurora and OpenSearch.</data>
